- **Schema Engine**: Prisma ORM v6.11.1 connected to PostgreSQL (Neon serverless).
- **High-Performance Composite Indexes**:
  - `@@index([status, deletedAt, publishedAt(sort: Desc)])`
  - `@@index([status, deletedAt, districtId, publishedAt(sort: Desc)])`
